"Pairing lets SayoSign install apps the way SideStore does, including apps signed with a free Apple ID. It needs iOS 27, Developer Mode and LocalDevVPN (free on the App Store) connected while installing." = "配对后，SayoSign 可以像 SideStore 一样安装应用，包括用免费 Apple ID 签名的应用。需要 iOS 27、开发者模式，并在安装时连接 LocalDevVPN（App Store 免费）。";
"Tap Pair, then open Settings → Privacy & Security → Developer Mode → Pair with SayoSign and type the code shown here." = "点按“配对”，然后打开“设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 开发者模式 → Pair with SayoSign”，输入此处显示的代码。";
"This iPhone is paired" = "此 iPhone 已配对";
"This is a lockdown pairing file. SayoSign needs an RPPairing file (iOS 27 pairing)." = "这是 lockdown 配对文件。SayoSign 需要 RPPairing 文件（iOS 27 配对）。";
"This is not a pairing file" = "这不是配对文件";
"Turn LocalDevVPN on, then check." = "请打开 LocalDevVPN 后检查。";
"Type this code on the iPhone" = "在 iPhone 上输入此代码";
"Uploading" = "正在上传";
"Waiting for the iPhone…" = "正在等待 iPhone…";
"Inside SayoSign" = "在 SayoSign 内";
"Run" = "运行";
"%@ starts when you open SayoSign again" = "再次打开 SayoSign 时将启动 %@";
"Run inside SayoSign (experimental)" = "在 SayoSign 内运行（实验性）";
"Like LiveContainer: not installed in iOS, no app limit. Use the same certificate SayoSign itself is signed with." = "类似 LiveContainer：不安装到 iOS，没有应用数量限制。请使用与 SayoSign 本身相同的证书签名。";
"SayoSign closes; open it again and the app starts inside it. Close that app and open SayoSign again to come back." = "SayoSign 会关闭；再次打开它，应用将在其中启动。关闭该应用并再次打开 SayoSign 即可返回。";
"Run inside SayoSign" = "在 SayoSign 内运行";
"The IPA has no app inside" = "IPA 中没有应用";
"Cannot prepare the app to run inside SayoSign" = "无法准备在 SayoSign 内运行该应用";
"%@ expires tomorrow" = "%@ 明天到期";
"Re-sign it in SayoSign with your Apple ID to keep it working." = "请在 SayoSign 中用你的 Apple ID 重新签名，以保持可用。";
"Could not advertise on the local network. Connect to Wi-Fi, allow Local Network for SayoSign (Settings → Privacy & Security → Local Network) and try again." = "无法在本地网络上广播。请连接 Wi-Fi，允许 SayoSign 使用本地网络（设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 本地网络），然后重试。";
"SayoSign pairing code: %@" = "SayoSign 配对代码：%@";
